              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhantö bhi ichika cha Abhagerisoni bhonsui bhano bhaisaini gökora ëmërëmo guitunteera re gusikanëra, bhano Mösa na Haruni bhaabharrë keebhörë ÖMÖNENE wanyoorrë ateebhiri Mösa na Haruni. ",
          "type": "text",
